M2.4 verify: disassembly of the three CPU kernels
release build, g++ -O3 -march=native (never -ffast-math), from build/release/libbench_core.a

The check: the operations each metric's definition names must appear in the loop that
run_batch() actually repeats, at the multiplicity the op count claims. An exact count
is a much stronger check than presence - it shows nothing was folded, hoisted or
strength-reduced away.
==============================================================================

